	(text "MT6701 encoder breakout (MT6701CT-ACD, LCSC C3202694), SSI output.\nMODE tied to VDD selects I2C/SSI (datasheet fig. 22). OUT and PUSH unused.\nDO on MAG_MISO, CLK on MAG_CLK, CSN on MAG_CS. J10 pin 4 (MOSI) is unused.\nJ10 pinout matches J5: use a straight-through GH cable. Magnet: 6 mm diametric, 0.5-2 mm gap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
